## E-mail sent to designated address when a metadata update, registration
 ## or reservation of a DOI fails.
 ##
 ## Parameters: {0} action (updating metadata of, registering or reserving)
 ## {1} Date & Time
 ## {2} resource type text
 ## {3} resource id
 ## {4} DOI
 ## {5} reason
 ##
 ## See org.dspace.core.Email for information on the format of this file.
 ##
 #set($subject = "Infoscience : Erreur de ${params[0]} pour le DOI ${params[3]}")
 
 Date : ${params[1]}
 
L'action ${params[0]} du DOI ${params[4]} de la ressource ${params[2]} avec l'identifiant ${params[3]} a échoué pour la raison suivante :
${params[5]}
